Update `vite.config.ts` to include:

```
import { defineConfig } from 'vitest/config';
export default defineConfig({
  test: {
    globals: true,
    environment: 'jsdom'
  }
});
```

This ensures the smoke tests can run in a DOM environment without a browser.
